2. inquiry        - grain: 1 row per inquiry. Columns: inquiry_id (deterministic surrogate PK - hash of conversation_id + array index, NOT random, so the value is reproducible across runs), conversation_id (FK), inquiry_number, inquiry_role, inquiry_parent_number, classification, description, resolution, status, inquiry_summary, updated_on
