- Final tables (prefix asdt_): asdt_wrapup_summary_conversation, asdt_wrapup_summary_inquiry, asdt_wrapup_summary_inquiry_intent, asdt_wrapup_summary_inquiry_key_point, asdt_wrapup_summary_inquiry_topic
